      "value": "@{5bafbca9282d5d55fb6899f8|full_name}: I think the issue is that there's no real alternative to dynamic bones. I understand people's concerns in that sense.\nPeople want moving hair, tails, ears, whatever, but Dynamic Bones even when used lightly can affect performance massive. A lot of people simply don't or refuse to understand this.",
